# The build context is ~/dev (compose uses `context: ..`), so these
# patterns are relative to that root, not to weft/. Without this file
# every build streamed the whole tree to the daemon — including the
# 500MB+ prod.sql dump and ~8GB of local dev/shard-data DuckDB files,
# which filled the disk. The images only need Go sources, the embedded
# migrations/schema, and deploy/ scripts from warp, saaskit and weft.
**/.git
**/node_modules
weft/frontend
weft/prod.sql
weft/*.sql.gz
weft/results*
weft/*.log
weft/coverage-baseline.*
weft/dev/demo/tokens.env
**/dist
weft/dev/shard-data
